---
---
<section class="team-section section-padding" id="team">
  <div class="container">
    
    <div class="team-header-wrapper">
      <div class="team-header-content">
        <span class="team-kicker" data-reveal style="--reveal-index: 0">Professional Leadership</span>
        <h2 class="team-title" data-reveal style="--reveal-index: 1">Governed by elite standards. Guided by empathy.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="team-intro-text" data-reveal style="--reveal-index: 2">
        Lakingz Services is led by seasoned Chartered Accountants and CPAs who brought their pedigree from <strong>Deloitte and KPMG</strong> to build a practice dedicated to your financial sovereignty.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Staggered asymmetric layout for people profile cards (no boring identical cards side-by-side) -->
    <div class="profiles-container">
      
      <!-- Profile 1: Oluwakemi (Image on Left, Content on Right) -->
      <div class="profile-row profile-primary">
        <div class="profile-image-container" data-reveal="left">
          <div class="image-accent-glow glow-mint"></div>
          <img
            src="/kemi-olugbade.webp"
            alt="Oluwakemi Olobade, Founder and Lead Accountant at Lakingz Services"
            class="profile-img"
          />
          <div class="credentials-badge">Founder & Lead</div>
        </div>

        <div class="profile-details" data-reveal="right">
          <div class="profile-header">
            <span class="profile-role">Lead Accountant</span>
            <h3 class="profile-name">Oluwakemi Olobade</h3>
            <span class="profile-specs">Chartered Accountant (CPA Canada Eligible) · Ex-Deloitte & KPMG</span>
          </div>
          
          <p class="profile-bio">
            Oluwakemi is the sole operator and driving vision behind Lakingz Services. Having earned her elite professional accounting credentials at <strong>KPMG</strong> and <strong>Deloitte</strong>, she brings world-class compliance expertise directly to local Brampton families and growing newcomer business communities. She oversees all day-to-day corporate tax prep, budgeting models, and direct advisory interactions.
          </p>

          <div class="responsibilities-block">
            <h4 class="block-title">Key Governance Focus</h4>
            <ul class="resp-list">
              <li>
                <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
                Corporate tax, bookkeeping structures & payroll systems
              </li>
              <li>
                <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
                CRA audit reviews & compliance defense representation
              </li>
              <li>
                <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
                Technology integration for secure, automated document workflows
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Profile 2: Kikelomo (Image on Right, Content on Left) -->
      <div class="profile-row profile-secondary">
        <div class="profile-details" data-reveal="left">
          <div class="profile-header">
            <span class="profile-role">CPA External Advisor</span>
            <h3 class="profile-name">Kikelomo Johnson-Yaya</h3>
            <span class="profile-specs">Chartered Accountant · CPA Canada</span>
          </div>
          
          <p class="profile-bio">
            Kikelomo serves as the senior advisory partner for Lakingz Services. With extensive auditing and corporate taxation experience gained at <strong>Deloitte</strong> and currently practicing as a licensed CPA in Canada, she brings deep expertise to the firm's compliance processes. She guides complex corporate structures, multi-provincial tax plans, and senior audit defense cases.
          </p>

          <div class="responsibilities-block">
            <h4 class="block-title">Advisory Oversight</h4>
            <ul class="resp-list">
              <li>
                <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
                CPA-level technical audit of complex filing files
              </li>
              <li>
                <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
                Corporate tax deferrals & legal minimization strategies
              </li>
              <li>
                <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
                Strategic scaling of newcomer-led business entities across Ontario
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="profile-image-container" data-reveal="right">
          <div class="image-accent-glow glow-blue"></div>
          <img
            src="/profile-placeholder.svg"
            alt=""
            class="profile-img profile-img--placeholder"
            role="presentation"
          />
          <div class="credentials-badge">Senior CPA Advisor</div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .team-section {
    background-color: var(--bg-surface);
    border-bottom: var(--sheet-border);
  }

  .team-header-wrapper {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    align-items: end;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
    border-bottom: var(--sheet-border);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .team-kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: var(--accent-mint);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xs);
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .team-title {
    font-size: var(--fs-2xl);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .team-intro-text {
    font-size: var(--fs-base);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Profiles Container */
  .profiles-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .profile-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    align-items: center;
  }

  /* Reversed grid for Kikelomo */
  .profile-secondary {
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
  }

  /* Profile Image Container */
  .profile-image-container {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 0.9;
    border-radius: 24px;
  }

  .profile-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 24px;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: top center;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);
    border: var(--sheet-border);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    filter: saturate(0.9);
  }

  .profile-img--placeholder {
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
    filter: none;
    background-color: oklch(96% 0.01 200);
  }

  /* Asymmetric accent glows under the portraits */
  .image-accent-glow {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -10px;
    border-radius: 30px;
    z-index: 1;
    filter: blur(15px);
    opacity: 0.35;
  }

  .glow-mint {
    background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--color-mint) 0%, transparent 70%);
  }

  .glow-blue {
    background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--color-blue) 0%, transparent 70%);
  }

  .credentials-badge {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -12px;
    right: 20px;
    background-color: var(--text-main);
    color: var(--color-mint);
    padding: 0.5em 1.2em;
    border-radius: 99px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    z-index: 3;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-mint);
  }

  /* Profile Details */
  .profile-details {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .profile-role {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    display: block;
  }

  .profile-name {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: var(--fs-xl);
    color: var(--text-main);
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }

  .profile-specs {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--accent-blue);
  }

  .profile-bio {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  /* Responsibilities Block */
  .responsibilities-block {
    background-color: oklch(98.8% 0.003 145);
    border: var(--sheet-border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: var(--space-md);
  }

  .block-title {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .resp-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .resp-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: start;
    gap: var(--space-2xs);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .check-icon {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    color: var(--accent-mint);
    margin-top: 3px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* Responsive styling */
  @media (max-width: 968px) {
    .team-header-wrapper {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-xs);
      align-items: start;
    }

    .profile-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-lg);
    }

    .profile-secondary {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    
    /* Reorder Kikelomo's layout on mobile so image is always on top */
    .profile-secondary .profile-image-container {
      order: -1;
    }

    .profile-image-container {
      max-width: 360px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
  }
</style>
